## 1. Definitions

**"Template"** means the Rails Rocket Sheep application template, comprising
`template.rb`, all files under `templates/`, the documentation under `docs/`,
and any updates or modified versions supplied to you by Licensor.

**"Generated Application"** means the Ruby on Rails application produced by
running the Template, together with your subsequent modifications to it.

**"You"** means the individual or legal entity that purchased the licence. If
you purchase on behalf of an organisation, "You" means that organisation and
you represent that you are authorised to bind it.

**"Developer"** means an individual who accesses, reads, or modifies the
Template itself. Individuals who only work on a Generated Application, without
access to the Template, are not Developers for the purposes of this agreement.

