## 5. Open-source Generated Applications

You may release a Generated Application under any licence you choose, including
open-source licences, provided that the release is a genuine application and
not, in substance, a redistribution of the Template.

A release is a redistribution of the Template if its principal value to a
recipient is as a starting point for building new applications, rather than as
a working application in its own right. Publishing a freshly generated,
substantially unmodified application is a redistribution and is not permitted.

If you are unsure whether a planned release falls within this section, contact
Licensor before publishing.

